			"notes": "+ Added a new green Lightstone variant: Lifestones, which generate in lush caves\n\n+ Striders now drop fireproof Strider Hide\n\n+ Added Lava Surfboards, crafted with Strider Hide and Netherite Ingots\n\n     Right-click the Surfboard to dismount\n\n     Hold left-shift to do surf-jump farther\n\n+ Lightstones now require Silk Touch to break after placing (configurable)\n\n+ Added 8 more music discs (7 songs from MNOG + Killing Machines)\n\n* Lightstones can now be placed in flowing water\n\n* Revamped shine animations for various Lightstone blocks\n\n- Removed Lightstones and Blightstones from fishing and bartering loot tables"
		},
